{"id":"wb-8-556","name":"辽源二战盟军战俘营旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"辽源二战盟军战俘营旧址","text":"辽源二战盟军战俘营旧址是位于中华人民共和国吉林省辽源市西安区的一座历史建筑。该建筑曾位于日本关东军辽源守备队驻扎的“北大营”内，第二次世界大战期间作为“奉天俘虏收容所第二所”，秘密关押了美军菲律宾军区司令乔纳森·温莱特、英国陆军中将阿瑟·欧内斯特·帕西瓦尔、第21任香港总督杨慕琦等高级官员。2019年10月7日，该遗址入选第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%BE%BD%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%8C%E6%88%98%E7%9B%9F%E5%86%9B%E6%88%98%E4%BF%98%E8%90%A5%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":87591074,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=87591074","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/64c985640f295fbd4677fd90.jpg","title":"辽源二战高级战俘关押遗址_1.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E8%BE%BD%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%8C%E6%88%98%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E6%88%98%E4%BF%98%E5%85%B3%E6%8A%BC%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_1.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/79/%E8%BE%BD%E6%BA%90%E4%BA%8C%E6%88%98%E9%AB%98%E7%BA%A7%E6%88%98%E4%BF%98%E5%85%B3%E6%8A%BC%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80_1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"E2568","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​辽源二战高级战俘关押遗址","width":320,"height":240}}